WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:17.893
"Ethan, wait!" Nina called.

2
00:00:17.894 --> 00:00:20.925
She ran to catch up with Ethan in the hallway.

3
00:00:20.926 --> 00:00:24.955
"Why are you wearing that winter jacket?" she asked.

4
00:00:24.956 --> 00:00:27.453
"Miss Shelly said we're going outside.

5
00:00:27.454 --> 00:00:30.585
It's cold!" Ethan said.

6
00:00:30.587 --> 00:00:32.856
"It's only October!

7
00:00:32.857 --> 00:00:35.145
Wait until January.

8
00:00:35.146 --> 00:00:38.794
Then it gets really cold. Brr."

9
00:00:38.795 --> 00:00:49.875
Nina shivered just thinking about it.

10
00:00:49.876 --> 00:00:53.166
"Line up at the door.

11
00:00:53.167 --> 00:01:00.469
We're taking a walk through the woods," Miss Shelly said.

12
00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:04.384
"For today's craft you'll need four autumn leaves.

13
00:01:04.385 --> 00:01:08.572
Carefully put them in your paper bag," Miss Shelly said.

14
00:01:08.573 --> 00:01:11.884
"I want to find red ones," Izzie said.

15
00:01:11.885 --> 00:01:13.993
"Maple leaves are pretty."

16
00:01:13.994 --> 00:01:16.092
"I want a mix.

17
00:01:16.093 --> 00:01:21.306
Orange, red, yellow, and brown," Nina said.

18
00:01:21.308 --> 00:01:24.182
"A mix sounds good," Ethan said.

19
00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:26.263
"I'll do that too."

20
00:01:26.264 --> 00:01:28.963
"A mix with brown?

21
00:01:28.964 --> 00:01:32.289
Brown is ugly," Izzie said.

22
00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:35.394
"I'm not using brown leaves."

23
00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:39.115
She ran to catch up with Miss Shelly.

24
00:01:39.116 --> 00:01:41.771
"Have fun with your boyfriend,"

25
00:01:41.772 --> 00:01:50.987
she called to Nina over her shoulder.

26
00:01:50.988 --> 00:01:54.823
"This leaf looks like a little fan!" Ethan said.

27
00:01:54.824 --> 00:01:57.676
He fanned Nina with his yellow leaf.

28
00:01:57.677 --> 00:02:01.154
"Ha! It does," Nina said.

29
00:02:01.155 --> 00:02:03.853
"I wonder what we're doing with them."

30
00:02:03.854 --> 00:02:08.341
"We're going to make window decorations," Miss Shelly said.

31
00:02:08.342 --> 00:02:11.272
"First we'll seal them in wax paper.

32
00:02:11.273 --> 00:02:14.703
Then we'll hang them on a string," Miss Shelly said.

33
00:02:14.704 --> 00:02:18.087
"Sounds easy," Jason said.

34
00:02:18.088 --> 00:02:21.600
"Sounds fun!" Nina said.

35
00:02:21.601 --> 00:02:24.903
"Put your leaves on one piece of wax paper.

36
00:02:24.904 --> 00:02:28.686
Make sure they are at least four centimeters apart.

37
00:02:28.687 --> 00:02:32.087
Then put another piece of wax paper on top.

38
00:02:32.088 --> 00:02:34.859
When you're done, line up near me.

39
00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:42.214
I'll iron them," Miss Shelly said.

40
00:02:42.215 --> 00:02:48.271
"Perfect," Izzie said, looking at her leaves. "All red."

41
00:02:48.272 --> 00:02:51.532
"Those look pretty, Izzie," Nina said.

42
00:02:51.533 --> 00:02:58.529
But Izzie ignored Nina and walked over to Miss Shelly.

43
00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:05.667
"I'm ready for ironing," she said.

44
00:03:05.668 --> 00:03:07.578
Nina was next.

45
00:03:07.579 --> 00:03:12.279
Miss Shelly carefully placed Nina's wax paper on the ironing board.

46
00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:16.365
She covered it with a rag and started to iron.

47
00:03:16.366 --> 00:03:20.799
"Is everything okay between you and Izzie?" she asked softly.

48
00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.548
Nina's eyes filled with tears.

49
00:03:23.549 --> 00:03:25.774
She shook her head.

50
00:03:25.775 --> 00:03:29.227
"What's going on?" Miss Shelly asked.

51
00:03:29.228 --> 00:03:32.146
"Izzie's being really mean today.

52
00:03:32.147 --> 00:03:35.809
I don't know why!" Nina said.

53
00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:38.677
"You and Ethan are getting along well.

54
00:03:38.678 --> 00:03:43.009
Maybe she feels left out," Miss Shelly suggested.

55
00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:46.914
"But Izzie is my best friend!" Nina said.

56
00:03:46.915 --> 00:03:52.026
"She probably needs time to get used to Ethan," Miss Shelly said.

57
00:03:52.027 --> 00:03:54.732
She handed Nina her leaves.

58
00:03:54.733 --> 00:03:56.698
"Here you go.

59
00:03:56.699 --> 00:03:58.756
Your leaves look great.

60
00:03:58.757 --> 00:04:03.768
In a few minutes, we'll cut them out."

61
00:04:03.769 --> 00:04:08.145
"Cut around the edges of your waxed leaves," Miss Shelly said.

62
00:04:08.146 --> 00:04:10.682
Jason and Izzie cut circles.

63
00:04:10.683 --> 00:04:14.091
Bobby and Ethan cut around the shape of the leaves.

64
00:04:14.092 --> 00:04:16.283
Nina cut squares.

65
00:04:16.284 --> 00:04:19.678
She was still thinking about what Miss Shelly had said.

66
00:04:19.679 --> 00:04:22.748
Was Izzie jealous of Ethan?

67
00:04:22.749 --> 00:04:25.727
"Now punch a hole near the stems.

68
00:04:25.728 --> 00:04:29.502
Then thread a long piece of string through each leaf.

69
00:04:29.503 --> 00:04:35.223
And finally tie knots on each end of the string," Miss Shelly said.

70
00:04:35.224 --> 00:04:39.901
"Can we hang them up now?" Nina asked.

71
00:04:39.902 --> 00:04:49.488
"Izzie, hang yours above mine!" Nina said.

72
00:04:49.489 --> 00:04:54.067
Izzie jumped up.

73
00:04:54.068 --> 00:04:59.363
"Your colored ones actually don't look that bad," she said, grinning.

74
00:04:59.364 --> 00:05:02.118
Nina smiled at her best friend.

75
00:05:02.119 --> 00:05:04.694
She liked making new friends.

76
00:05:04.695 --> 00:05:14.991
But she didn't want to lose her old ones.
